The sdCup is a premier weekend tournament featuring a hefty prize pool and top class talent. It encourages even pings allowing for the entire world to participate online in epic weekend bouts between the best players out there. 

The third  installment is all about [[race|racing]], and competition will be fierce up to the deadline of '''23:59 CEST/5:59pm EDT April 25'''.

===New map===
[[File:Map anubis in hurry pillars.jpg|180px|frameless|left]]
In collaboration with {{Player|Anni|flag=de}}, the famous race map maker, the third sdCup will be a [[race]] competition on his brand new map '''[[Race17 sdcup|Anubis in hurry]]''' (<mark>race17_sdcup.bsp</mark>). 

This fresh map features difficult bunny hops, sliding/surfing and the potential of some really extreme speeds, all set in a nice egyptian themed environment. 

