===How to compete===
# Get on a '''badplace.eu''' server (london.badplace.eu:28501-28504), alternatively a server connected to the badplace.eu API.
# Type <mark>/race17_sdcup</mark> in the console to switch map to the competition map, followed by <mark>/race</mark> to enable the mode "race". 
# Type <mark>/ready</mark> and you should be starting a race! That's it!

===Reporting===

The badplace.eu servers store the scores themselves so there's no need to report anything! If you end up in the top 10, a demo will be saved and your score will be displayed on [https://www.badplace.eu/Race/Route/120 badplace.eu/Race/Route/120]! 


If you have any questions, don't hesitate to ask in the <mark>#sdCup</mark> channel on [http://discord.quake.world discord.quake.world].

===Streaming===

[https://www.twitch.tv/suddendeathTV suddendeathTV] will host a live stream after the deadline (Sunday 25th) going through demos and results. 

